# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:2
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_f6e99e92:

    # "The door opened inch by inch as Arlena’s face peeped surreptitiously through the gap."
    "Arlena가 틈 사이로 몰래 얼굴을 내밀자 문이 조금씩 열렸다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:3
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_47123286:

    # "She averted her gaze as the air touched her rosy cheeks."
    "바람이 그녀의 붉어진 볼을 스치자 그녀는 시선을 돌렸다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:4
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_c41453c7:

    # MC @ talk "Arlena? Is everything alright?"
    MC @ talk "Arlena? 괜찮아?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:5
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_250c2268:

    # ARLENA "Yes, just give me a moment..."
    ARLENA "응, 잠깐만..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:10
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_2b255700:

    # "She sealed the door shut for a moment before opening it fully to allow me to inspect what was on the other side."
    "그녀는 잠시 문을 닫았다가, 내가 안쪽을 살펴볼 수 있도록 활짝 열어주었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:11
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_f160d8e1:

    # "Arlena smiled, wrapped in a warm furry blanket that hung off her bare shoulders."
    "Arlena는 맨 어깨에 걸친 따뜻한 털 담요를 두른 채 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:12
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_17cf5076:

    # "I had to tear my eyes away from the cute little mole on her collar bone, wanting nothing more than to reach out and touch her."
    "그녀의 쇄골 위에 있는 귀여운 점에서 억지로 시선을 떼어내야 했다. 손을 뻗어 만지고 싶은 충동을 간신히 참았다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:13
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_dfb9c9c2:

    # "She had placed various candles around the room, illuminating it with a warm, soft kind of light."
    "그녀는 방 여기저기 양초를 두어 따뜻하고 부드러운 빛으로 방을 밝혔다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:14
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_8a2997f2:

    # "Placed on the floor was a small white blanket, keenly laid out with a few pieces of food she had managed to pull together in a wooden bowl."
    "바닥에는 작은 흰색 담요가 깔려 있었고, 나무 그릇에 정성스럽게 담아낸 음식이 준비되어 있었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:15
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_0f98a9a9:

    # "Sat beside it was a half empty bottle of wine with two glasses already poured out waiting for us."
    "그 옆에는 반쯤 비워진 와인 병과 우리를 위해 미리 따라놓은 두 잔의 잔이 기다리고 있었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:16
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_360d119a:

    # ARLENA "It isn’t much but..."
    ARLENA "별거 아니지만..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:17
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_2aa2b523:

    # ARLENA "It’s all I could cobble together."
    ARLENA "겨우 마련한 게 다야."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:20
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_60ace262:

    # ARLENA "And ruin the surprise? Please."
    ARLENA "서프라이즈를 망치고? 제발."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:21
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_e3382014:

    # ARLENA "You’re a guest, I didn’t want to trouble you with petty tasks after everything you’ve done for me already."
    ARLENA "넌 손님이야. 이미 나를 위해 그렇게 많은 일을 해줬는데 사소한 일로 귀찮게 하고 싶지 않았어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:22
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_bf065817:

    # MC @ talk "Look at you being nice."
    MC @ talk "친절하게 나오네."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:24
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_5638156f:

    # ARLENA "Glad you think so."
    ARLENA "그렇게 생각해줘서 다행이야."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:26
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_9d365dc3:

    # ARLENA "It’s... It’s cold is all!"
    ARLENA "그냥... 추워서 그러는 거야!"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:27
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_96c1e2d5:

    # ARLENA "Come on, let’s dig in..."
    ARLENA "어서, 먹어보자..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:29
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_97590d4b:

    # "We split the food in the bowl between us and laughed over old stories as we made our way through the wine."
    "우리는 그릇의 음식을 나누고, 와인을 마시면서 옛날 이야기들을 하며 웃었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:30
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_6364ebb4:

    # ARLENA "Hahaha! Do you remember Viktor’s ‘Great Potato Scam’?"
    ARLENA "하하하! Viktor의 ‘위대한 감자 사기극’ 기억나?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:31
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_b6285f18:

    # MC @ talk "Oh yes, he swore hands down he had figured out a way to grow them himself faster than all the farmers could combined."
    MC @ talk "그래, 그는 모든 농부들을 합친 것보다 더 빨리 감자를 직접 기를 수 있는 방법을 알아냈다고 장담했지."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:32
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_5521c0f9:

    # MC @ talk "He was offering huge sacks of potatoes for practically nothing."
    MC @ talk "그는 거의 공짜로 엄청난 양의 감자 자루를 팔고 있었어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:37
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_b285fc8e:

    # "Between snorts of laughter, Arlena struggled to hold down her mouthful of wine as she reminisced."
    "웃음을 터뜨리면서 Arlena는 추억에 잠기며 입에 문 와인을 삼키려고 애썼다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:38
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_1342b385:

    # ARLENA @ smile "The little shit only had the top layer be actual potatoes, beneath all that he’d just painted a load of rocks! "
    ARLENA @ smile "그 새끼는 윗층만 진짜 감자였고, 그 아래는 돌맹이에 페인트만 칠한 거였어! "

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:39
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_663dcfdf:

    # ARLENA @ smile "I still remember the mob chasing him now!"
    ARLENA @ smile "지금도 그를 쫓던 군중들이 생각나!"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:40
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_a613ced5:

    # MC @ talk "He swore blind they were just funny shaped, hard, ‘exotic’ potatoes!"
    MC @ talk "그는 그것들이 그저 이상한 모양의, 딱딱한 ‘이국적인’ 감자라고 굴하게 우겨댔어!"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:41
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_d757d49d:

    # ARLENA "Didn’t someone break his nose for that?"
    ARLENA "그 때문에 누가 그의 코를 부러뜨리지 않았나?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:42
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_51202ee1:

    # MC @ talk "Yes! When he caught up to him, he said something like ‘here’s something ‘exotic’ for you to try, boy!’ "
    MC @ talk "그래! 그를 따라잡았을 때, 그가 말했지. ‘여기 진짜 ‘이국적인’ 걸 맛보렴, 애송아!’ 라고."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:43
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_7366dea8:

    # "Arlena laughed once again as we remembered Viktor being dropped by the old farmer’s punch."
    "Arlena는 늙은 농부의 주먹에 Viktor가 쓰러지던 것을 기억하며 다시 웃었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:44
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_b3a9f82c:

    # ARLENA "As much of an ass he was, he was quite cute."
    ARLENA "천하에 없을 놈이었지만, 그래도 꽤 귀여웠어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:45
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_f8f38e67:

    # MC @ talk "Who? The old farmer?"
    MC @ talk "누구? 그 늙은 농부?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:46
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_bb71a8bc:

    # ARLENA "Noooo, Viktor of course!"
    ARLENA "아니야, 당연히 Viktor!"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:47
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_bf6f3526:

    # ARLENA "{i}Dumbass.{/i}"
    ARLENA "{i}바보.{/i}"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:48
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_68d1fd89:

    # MC @ talk "Oh no..."
    MC @ talk "오, 안 돼..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:49
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_722badb0:

    # ARLENA "He was! He had this little button nose!"
    ARLENA "그랬다구! 조그만 동그란 코를 가졌었어!"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:50
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_4931e836:

    # MC @ talk "His voice sounded like a cat drowning."
    MC @ talk "그의 목소리는 물에 빠지는 고양이 같았다구."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:51
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_f2f0745d:

    # ARLENA "Well, I liked him."
    ARLENA "그래도, 난 그가 좋았어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:52
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_98ae856a:

    # MC @ talk "... You liked Viktor?"
    MC @ talk "... Viktor를 좋아했다고?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:53
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_7b6bb866:

    # ARLENA "We went out once..."
    ARLENA "한 번 데이트한 적 있어..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:54
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_5e90ebf6:

    # MC @ talk "Oh? Just the once?"
    MC @ talk "오? 딱 한 번?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:55
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_ba8c73f7:

    # ARLENA "Yeah, but nothing happened or anything like that."
    ARLENA "응, 근데 아무 일도 없었어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:56
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_44044d4c:

    # ARLENA "Just didn’t feel right."
    ARLENA "그냥 왠지 좋지 않았어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:57
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_159bf8b3:

    # MC @ talk "How come?"
    MC @ talk "왜?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:58
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_5180d965:

    # "Arlena paused for a moment, choosing her words with care as she took a sip of her wine."
    "Arlena는 와인을 한 모금 마시며 신중하게 말을 골랐다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:59
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_6d1923e8:

    # ARLENA "Well..."
    ARLENA "글쎄..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:60
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_304e9042:

    # ARLENA "I had someone else on my mind at the time, so..."
    ARLENA "그땐 다른 사람이 마음에 있었거든, 그래서..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:61
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_d674520f:

    # "As Arlena shyly looked away, it dawned on me exactly {i}who{/i} had been on her mind."
    "Arlena가 수줍게 시선을 돌리자, 그녀의 마음에 있었던 그 {i}누군가{/i}가 누군지 깨달았다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:62
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_186fc647:

    # MC @ talk "... Ah."
    MC @ talk "... 아."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:63
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_8a61850d:

    # ARLENA "It’s fine, it was a long time ago, my standards were extremely low."
    ARLENA "괜찮아, 오래전 일이야. 내 눈이 엄청 낮았었으니까."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:64
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_20af471b:

    # ARLENA "... And you were an ass."
    ARLENA "... 그리고 넌 짜증나는 놈이었어."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:65
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_22ff4802:

    # MC @ talk "... But I’m likable now, huh?"
    MC @ talk "... 하지만 이젠 호감이 가지, 그치?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:66
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_90004009:

    # "Arlena smiled alluringly before once again reaching to grab her wine."
    "Arlena는 매혹적으로 미소를 지으며 다시 와인을 집으러 손을 뻗었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:67
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_a1831a05:

    # ARLENA "Yes..."
    ARLENA "그래..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:68
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_1627ab5c:

    # ARLENA "You are {i}tolerable{/i}."
    ARLENA "넌 {i}참을 만해{/i}."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:69
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_64ecede6:

    # MC @ talk "As are you, m’lady."
    MC @ talk "당신도 마찬가지죠, 숙녀."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:70
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_8983e408:

    # "I raised my drink."
    "난 잔을 들어 올렸다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:71
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_fb88f9c8:

    # MC @ talk "Here’s to being tolerable."
    MC @ talk "참을 수 있는 것을 위하여."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:72
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_d25deed9:

    # "Arlena playfully clinked her drink against mine, but after swigging the last of it down and reaching over for the bottle to refill it, she realised it was empty."
    "Arlena는 장난스럽게 잔을 부딪히고, 마지막 한 모금을 들이켠 후 병을 집어 다시 채우려다 비어있는 걸 깨달았다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:73
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_4ec86ff2:

    # ARLENA "Oh! We’re out of wine..."
    ARLENA "어! 와인이 떨어졌어..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:74
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_c5bed80f:

    # ARLENA "Heh... Time flies, huh? "
    ARLENA "히... 시간 빨리 가네, 그치? "

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:80
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_adc08c4b:

    # "Changing the subject, we spent the rest of the... date contentedly chatting about other things till finally, she waved me off into the cool night air to make my way home."
    "화제를 바꾸고, 우리는 데이트의 나머지 시간을 다른 이야기들로 즐겁게 보내고, 마침내 그녀는 시원한 밤공기 속으로 나를 배웅했다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:81
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_b39cecf2:

    # "I couldn’t help but notice, despite the pleasantness of the evening, there was {i}a tinge of disappointment{/i} in her voice as I made my move to leave."
    "즐거운 저녁이었지만, 내가 떠나려고 할 때 그녀의 목소리에 {i}실망감이 스며들어있는 것{/i}을 느껴지지 않을 수 없었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:86
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_dfe1d604:

    # ARLENA "Thanks for a good time, turns out you CAN be a gentleman when you put your mind to it."
    ARLENA "즐거운 시간 고마워. 마음만 먹으면 신사도 될 수 있네."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:87
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_afd647ee:

    # MC @ talk "Yeah, thank you too!"
    MC @ talk "응, 나도 고마워!"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:88
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_a51aef82:

    # MC @ talk "I'll be going now."
    MC @ talk "이제 가볼게."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:89
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_cee7a7a3:

    # MC @ talk "Take care, Arlena."
    MC @ talk "잘 있어, Arlena."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:90
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_d633fcc7:

    # "With a heavy heart, I left the smithy."
    "무거운 마음으로 대장간을 떠나왔다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:96
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_0bd83054:

    # ARLENA "W-What do you mean?"
    ARLENA "무, 무슨 말이야?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:97
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_9d168846:

    # MC @ talk "... Well."
    MC @ talk "... 글쎄."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:98
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_173d1d2a:

    # MC @ talk "It’s just, tell me if I’m reading this wrong but..."
    MC @ talk "그냥, 내가 잘못 읽고 있는 거라면 말해줘, 근데..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:99
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_27744584:

    # MC @ talk "You didn’t just invite me here tonight to reminisce about our time at school, did you?"
    MC @ talk "오늘 밤 학교 시절 추억하자고 불러낸 건 아니지, 그치?"

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:100
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_640ae29c:

    # "Arlena said nothing, her mouth hung slightly open as she stared wide eyed at me in waiting."
    "Arlena는 아무 말도 하지 않고, 입을 살짝 벌린 채 기대에 찬 눈빛으로 나를 바라보았다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:103
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_f684eedb:

    # "I inched towards Arlena, never breaking eye contact before placing a tender kiss onto her lips."
    "난 Arlena에게 천천히 다가가, 시선을 떼지 않고 부드러운 키스를 했다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:104
