    ARLENA "이게 더 나은 거야."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:190
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_7c2121fa:

    # "I nodded, only half convinced."
    "난 반쯤만 납득한 채 고개를 끄덕였다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:191
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_0691cd97:

    # ARLENA "Anyway, you better get out of here."
    ARLENA "어쨌든, 얼른 가는 게 좋을 거야."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:192
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_661d432c:

    # ARLENA "If father catches us two together, hell..."
    ARLENA "아버지가 우리 둘이 함께 있는 걸 들키면, 세상에..."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:193
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_342ec5bf:

    # ARLENA "If he knew half of what I got up to, he’d flip his lid."
    ARLENA "내가 뭘 하고 다니는지 절반만 알아도 난박으로 뛰어들 거야."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:194
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_336a39e3:

    # "Getting dressed, Arlena soon saw me out the smithy."
    "옷을 입은 Arlena는 곧 대장간에서 나를 배웅해주었다."

# game/data/world_romance/arlena/intro_doggy.rpy:195
translate kr rom_ArlenaIntroDoggy_fa4c8adb:

    # "Waving me off, she reminding me to come back for ‘more work’ soon..."
    "나를 배웅하며, 그녀는 곧 ‘더 많은 일’을 하러 돌아오라고 상기시켰다..."

